{
  "info": {
    "name": "FSMS - Feature 15 - Assign Technician and Schedule Appointment",
    "description": "Postman collection for Feature 15.\n\nEndpoint:\n- POST /api/v1/work-orders/:id/assignment   (MANAGER, ADMIN)\n\nBody:\n- technicianId (string, UUID, required)\n- startTime (ISO string, required)\n- endTime (ISO string, optional)\n\nRules enforced:\n- WorkOrder must be AWAITING_ASSIGNMENT.\n- Technician user must be ACTIVE and not deleted.\n- Self-assignment guard: technician userId cannot equal work order customerId (400).\n- endTime defaults to startTime + service estimatedDurationMinutes if omitted; must be after startTime.\n- Transaction with advisory lock pg_advisory_xact_lock(4242, hashtext(technicianId)) and overlap check (409 on conflict).\n- Creates Assignment (PENDING) and Appointment (SCHEDULED), updates WorkOrder to ASSIGNED.\n- Logs audit (TECHNICIAN_ASSIGNED, APPOINTMENT_SCHEDULED) and notifies customer and technician (category ASSIGNMENT).\n\nSetup:\n1. Import this collection.\n2. Set collection variables (baseUrl, managerEmail/Password, adminEmail/Password, customerEmail/Password, technicianEmail/Password, technicianId).\n3. Run folder 0 Auth + Setup to obtain tokens and discover an AWAITING_ASSIGNMENT workOrderId.\n4. Run folder 1 Assign Technician (Happy path & Overlap).\n5. Run folder 2 Access Control & Validation.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000" },
    { "key": "managerEmail", "value": "manager@example.com" },
    { "key": "managerPassword", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@example.com" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "" },
    { "key": "customerEmail", "value": "customer@example.com" },
    { "key": "customerPassword", "value": "" },
    { "key": "technicianEmail", "value": "technician@example.com" },
    { "key": "technicianPassword", "value": "" },
    { "key": "managerToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "customerToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "technicianToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "workOrderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "technicianId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Auth + Setup (run first)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login as MANAGER",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Manager login succeeds', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('managerToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{managerEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{managerPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as ADMIN",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Admin login succeeds', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', pm.response.json().data.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as CUSTOMER",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Customer login succeeds', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('customerToken', pm.response.json().data.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{customerEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{customerPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as TECHNICIAN",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Technician login succeeds', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('technicianToken', pm.response.json().data.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{technicianEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{technicianPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Discover workOrderId (GET /service-requests)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Service requests list succeeds', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const row = (json.data || []).find(r => r.workOrder && r.workOrder.status === 'AWAITING_ASSIGNMENT');",
                  "pm.test('An AWAITING_ASSIGNMENT work order exists', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(row, 'No AWAITING_ASSIGNMENT work order found. Approve a request first (Feature 9).').to.exist;",
                  "});",
                  "if (row) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('workOrderId', row.workOrder.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-requests?page=1&limit=50",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{managerToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Assign Technician",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /work-orders/:id/assignment (Happy Path with explicit endTime)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Technician assigned successfully', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('ASSIGNED');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.assignment).to.exist;",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.assignment.status).to.eql('PENDING');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.assignment.appointment).to.exist;",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.assignment.appointment.status).to.eql('SCHEDULED');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"technicianId\": \"{{technicianId}}\",\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-12-01T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"endTime\": \"2026-12-01T11:30:00.000Z\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/assignment",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{managerToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /work-orders/:id/assignment (Overlap conflict -> expect 409)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Overlap conflict returns 409', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"technicianId\": \"{{technicianId}}\",\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-12-01T10:30:00.000Z\",\n  \"endTime\": \"2026-12-01T12:00:00.000Z\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/assignment",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{managerToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Access Control & Validation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "CUSTOMER calls assignment endpoint (expect 403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Customer forbidden', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"technicianId\": \"{{technicianId}}\",\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-12-02T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/assignment",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{customerToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Missing technicianId (expect 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Validation error for missing technicianId', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-12-02T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/assignment",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{managerToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
